Version: 1.0.2
desc: JuKnow Chorus (junologue-chorus)
author: chmaha
changelog:
  The name now shows the original plugin (junologue-chorus), and the GUI credits it.
  Tone changes smoothly (no stepping when automated).
  Resizable GUI: the window scales to fit and stays centred.
about:
  Juno-style chorus with modes I, I+II and II, tone and mix controls,
  ported from junologue-chorus by Peter Allwin
  https://github.com/peterall/junologue-chorus (MIT)
  JSFX version released under MIT license

// Ported from junologue-chorus by Peter Allwin. MIT.
// https://github.com/peterall/junologue-chorus
//
// Copyright 2020 Peter Allwin
//
